1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,591
Every single night, the lonely boy desperately wished he could completely stop time.

2
00:00:05,591 --> 00:00:11,375
Then one miraculous day, his deepest wish finally came true across the quiet room.

3
00:00:11,375 --> 00:00:17,640
He could suddenly freeze everything around him, including falling rain and bustling people everywhere.

4
00:00:17,640 --> 00:00:23,736
During these moments of absolute control, he initially felt like an almighty powerful god.

5
00:00:23,736 --> 00:00:30,000
He selfishly used his incredible power to easily win fights and completely avoid all pain.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:37,103
However, slowly and painfully, he began to notice a truly terrifying and irreversible cost.

7
00:00:37,103 --> 00:00:43,295
Every single time time stopped, someone he loved dearly forgot a precious memory forever.

8
00:00:43,295 --> 00:00:49,200
Completely desperate now, he stopped time one final time and whispered his broken truth.

9
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:54,504
He gently let time flow again, choosing a real world where he could stay close.

10
00:00:54,504 --> 00:00:59,376
For the very first time in his life, he proudly chose to grow older.
